  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "そうそう、最高だよー！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004040020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、ありがとうございます\r\nカメラマンさんのおかげですね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600404/2006004040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004040030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだ……\r\nせっかくだから、この綺麗な砂浜を活かして……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600404/2006004040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（今日の咲耶の雰囲気、すごくいいな\r\nカメラマンやスタッフもかなり好感触みたいだ）",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
