  },
  {
    "id": 2006004040340,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アイドルになって、少しずつ叶えているこの夢……\r\nでも、まだまだ足りないんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600404/2006004040340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004040350,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "世界なんて、無謀だと笑う人もいるかもしれない\r\n私だって、それが困難な道だとは理解している",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600404/2006004040350"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004040360,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だけど、プロデューサー。アナタと一緒なら\r\nそんな困難すらも楽しめる気がするんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600404/2006004040360"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004040370,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "新しい場所で、新しい笑顔に出会い続ける\r\n私は、そんなふうに生きていきたい",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600404/2006004040370"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004040380,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから、いつか私を\r\nこの海の向こうまで連れて行ってくれないかい……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600404/2006004040380"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、もちろん\r\n咲耶なら世界だって夢中にさせられるはずだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004040390,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……全くアナタって人は、\r\n私以上に乗り気じゃないか",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600404/2006004040390"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004040400,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
